# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Genshin Pull Planner
#
# Python 3.12 project, tested with pytest (see tests/ and conftest.py).
# Phase 6 exposes the engines over FastAPI (api/, run with
# `uvicorn api.main:app --reload`); Phase 7 serves the static dashboard in
# frontend/index.html from that same app, so there is no JavaScript build step.
# Covers interpreter/pytest caches, virtual environments, coverage and build
# output, editor/OS noise, and personal scratch files/archives at the root.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python bytecode / interpreter caches ----------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# --- pytest / typing / linting caches --------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
.ruff_cache/
.pytype/
.hypothesis/
.benchmarks/

# --- Coverage & profiling output -------------------------------------------
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
nosetests.xml
*.prof
*.lprof

# --- Build / distribution output -------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
*.egg
pip-wheel-metadata/
.installed.cfg
MANIFEST

# --- Virtual environments & local secrets ----------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Notebook checkpoints --------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Editors / IDEs --------------------------------------------------------
# Ignore .vscode wholesale, but keep the shared workspace settings so a fresh
# clone still opens with the expected interpreter configuration.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.vs/
*.swp
*.swo
*.sublime-workspace

# --- OS cruft --------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- Frontend tooling (Phase 7) --------------------------------------------
# frontend/index.html is a plain static page today - the API serves it with no
# build step - so nothing here is generated yet. These patterns are the usual
# front-end debris, in case the dashboard grows a bundler.
node_modules/
.vite/
.parcel-cache/
.next/
.nuxt/
.svelte-kit/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- Local databases & runtime data (Phase 6) ------------------------------
# api/repository.py stores accounts in memory and api/jobs.py is non-durable,
# so nothing is written to disk today. This guards the documented drop-in
# database behind AccountRepository: it must never keep local account data
# (owned characters, pity, wish counts) in version control.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm

# --- Local snapshots & archives --------------------------------------------
# Whole-project snapshots taken to share the tree ("Genshin Pull Planner.zip").
# They duplicate the working tree, go stale immediately and, in this repo's
# case, still carried committed __pycache__ bytecode. Zip them up somewhere
# outside the checkout instead.
/*.zip
/*.tar.gz
/*.tgz
/*.7z
/*.rar

# --- Local scratch notes, logs & temp files --------------------------------
# Root-anchored so real test modules named the same way are unaffected.
/thinking.md
/test_ground.py
scratch/
*.log
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej

.clineignore